<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},&nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;
<p>Thank you for contacting Qantas Customer Care about your booking reference {{{Case.Booking_PNR__c}}}.</p>

<p><b>-<i>If chasing refund on refundable ticket now refunded use:-</i></b></p>

<p><strong>Your refund is on&nbsp; its way</strong><br />
I've spoken with our ticketing department who have confirmed that your refund has been processed. You should see the amount credited to the original form of payment within 7 business days.</p>

<p><b>-<i>If non refundable ticket booked online use:-</i></b></p>

<p><strong>Acknowledgement of Fare Conditions</strong><br />
I understand things don't always go as planned and you were unable to travel with us on this occasion. We do our best to ensure that our customers understand our fare types and conditions prior to booking with us. Your booking made via Qantas.com required your acknowledgement and acceptance of the Fare conditions and the Conditions of Carriage before proceeding with the booking. As your fare type is non-refundable, you're not eligible for a refund. However, the tax amount of &lt;$00.00&gt;AUD has been refunded to the original form of payment on &lt;Date&gt;&nbsp;</p>

<p><b>-<i>If non refundable ticket booked through Contact Centres use:-</i></b></p>

<p><strong>Acknowledgement of Fare Conditions</strong><br />
I understand things don't always go as planned and you were unable to travel with us on this occasion. When making a booking through our Contact Centres, our consultants are required to explain the booking terms and conditions before proceeding with the booking. Because your fare type is non refundable, you're not eligible for a refund.</p>

<p><b>-<i>If non refundable ticket listened to the call add:-</i></b></p>

<p><strong>Acknowledgement of Fare Conditions</strong><br />
I've listened to your call and can confirm that the consultant you spoke to on &lt;Date&gt;&nbsp;went through the conditions and you agreed to them before providing payment details. Because your fare type is non refundable, you're not eligible for a refund.</p>

<p><strong>I'm here to help</strong><br />
I appreciate you may be disappointed that we're unable to offer you a refund. We suggest that you check with your travel insurance provider as your travel insurance policy may cover these sorts of situations. Please let me know if you'd like me to provide you with&nbsp; an insurance letter to assist with a claim.</p>

<p>Thank you again for reaching out and hope to welcome you onboard again soon.<br />
<br />
Kind regards,</p>
</body>
